B.Ln=new A.eU("MindDuel","Get ready to challenge your instincts and dive deep into your decision-making skills with Mind Duel \u2013 a fresh twist on the classic \u201cWould You Rather\u201d game! Whether you're seeking a laugh, a deep conversation, or just a quick escape from boredom, Mind Duel has you covered.","\ud83e\udde0",B.FM,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.app.mind_duel",null,null)
