B.Lr=new A.eU("MindJournal \u2014 Personal Journal App","The app integrates an AI-powered mood tracker that analyzes the text of each entry to detect the user's emotional state, automatically tagging entries with mood insights and helping users visualize emotional patterns over time.\n\nKey Features:\n\u2022 Daily journal entries with rich text input\n\u2022 Image upload and attachment for each entry\n\u2022 Unified timeline showing all entries by date\n\u2022 AI-based mood detection and tracking from entry content\n\u2022 Mood history and trend visualization","\ud83d\udcd4",B.Gs,null,null,null)
